; ⚠️ GENERATED BY tools/gen_regions.py FROM tools/region_spec_frostfang.py. Edit the spec.
;
; ====================================================================================================
; FROSTFANG REACH AFTER THE 2026-08-29 GEOGRAPHY OVERHAUL
; ====================================================================================================
;
; ⚠️ THE REACH MOVED OUT OF THE EMBER CROWN'S COORDINATE SPACE, AND THAT WAS A LATENT BUG, NOT A
; DESIGN. dragon_roost sat at (25, 0, -20) and ancient_aerie at (25, 0, -110), which is inside the
; Ember Crown's arena and northern wilds; RegionStreamer's header carried "both regions cannot be
; resident at once" as a documented limitation for that reason alone. The Reach now occupies
; x 260..600, z -320..70 — nothing overlaps anything, and the constraint went with the overlap.
;
; WHAT CHANGED. Five cells packed into 250 x 200 metres became ten across 340 x 380, and the Clan
; Hold no longer has two dragon territories starting at its property line: the Wild roost is 115 m
; west of the hold's centre and the Ash roost 115 m east, with the hold's own shoulders of mountain
; in between, and the Ancient's aerie is 220 metres and three cells north of the hold up a glacier
; pass and a mountain traverse. Five new cells carry that distance: two southern marches (the
; arrival), a snowfield, a high ascent and an unroaded approach behind the ash crater.
;
; WHAT DID NOT CHANGE. The moot ring, the work terrace and the beast runs; the Splintered Shelf; the
; long exposed causeway into the ash crater; the bent procession, the standing-stone crescent and the
; hidden hoard. Every one of them is now cut into real elevation instead of drawn on a 90 m platform.
;
;   ROW z -300..-190   ancient_aerie (x 260..400)      aerie_ascent (400..600)
;   ROW z -190..-100   north_snowfield (260..380)  glacier (380..500)  ash_approach (500..600)
;   ROW z -100..-10    dragon_roost (260..370)     clan_hold (370..490)  ash_roost (490..600)
;   ROW z  -10..70     frost_march_w (260..430)    frost_march_e (430..600)
;
; ⚠️ THE PLAYER NOW ARRIVES 110 METRES SOUTH OF THE HOLD. SpawnPoint is (415, 1.2, 55), in the
; southern march, and the road climbs north to the gate. Arriving inside a settlement is what made
; the Reach read as one room; arriving in weather with the hold's smoke on the skyline is the region
; introducing itself.


