; frostfang_reach.dragon_roost   centre (315.0, -55.0)   110 x 90   x 260..370  z -100..-10
; THE WILD DRAGON'S ROOST — the Splintered Shelf, and it is a shelf. A twelve-metre
; flat-topped platform with 51-degree sides sits in the north-west of the cell and the nest
; is on top of it; the only way up is the shelf path, which climbs twelve metres over
; eighteen and is the steepest walkable ground in the realm on purpose. The splinter field
; east of the narrows is two rock ridges standing out of the ground rather than a scattering
; of boulders, the narrows squeeze between two more, and there is a twenty-metre ice wall
; closing the north. The land drops five metres south of the shelf, so the nest looks down
; on its own approach.

