; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; frostfang_reach.clan_hold   centre (430.0, -55.0)   120 x 90   x 370..490  z -100..-10
; THE CLAN HOLD — the moot ring, the work terrace and the beast runs survive; what changed
; is that they are no longer three functional zones distributed across a flat 60 m
; platform. A twenty-two-metre mountain wall stands across the whole north of the cell and
; two shoulders of it come down either side, so the hold sits in the shelter the clan chose
; it for. The moot is level ground at zero, the work terrace is genuinely a terrace 2.2 m
; up, and the beast runs are dug 1.6 m down — a settlement that follows its own ground. The
; land falls four metres south into the march, so the hold is above its own road.

