; frostfang_reach.ash_roost   centre (545.0, -55.0)   110 x 90   x 490..600  z -100..-10
; THE ASH ROOST — a real crater and a real causeway. The rim is an eight-metre ring of
; raised ground and the floor inside it is four metres down, so the fight happens twelve
; metres below its own skyline; the only graded way in is the bowl path, which ramps
; through the rim at a walkable angle. The approach is a raised natural causeway with the
; ground dropped six metres on BOTH sides of it — thirty-four metres with nowhere to stand
; except the road, which is what the encounter was always asking the props to do.

