; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; frostfang_reach.aerie_ascent   centre (500.0, -245.0)   200 x 110   x 400..600  z -300..-190
; THE AERIE ASCENT — two hundred metres of high traverse between the glacier pass and the
; massif, under a thirty-metre range. A hundred metres of road with a corrie below it and
; nothing on it. This is the cell that makes the aerie feel remote rather than adjacent.

